    "body": "I would move your text over to this step. This step is already clear that the behavior is to always reset the backing to a new bitmap (i.e. not preserve the drawing buffer). Therefore, the new text could be non-normative note that clarifies that this behavior stands, regardles of the value of WebGL's preserveDrawingBuffer setting.",
